  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nNumbers = 7575438, 7132975, 7397665, 7497194\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nIf a number ÷ 41 gives remainder 0, then it is divisible by 41\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 7132975 ÷ 41\n\n⇒ 41 × 174000 = 7134000\n\n⇒ 7134000 − 7132975 = 1025\n\n⇒ 1025 ÷ 41 = 25\n\n⇒ 174000 − 25 = 173975\n\n⇒ 7132975 = 41 × 173975\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 7132975.**",
